WEBVTT

01:31.000 --> 01:32.760
Even if the day comes when I must marry,

01:33.760 --> 01:36.520
I would seek a man who can share with me

01:36.600 --> 01:37.680
the trials and triumphs of life,

01:38.280 --> 01:39.480
one who will stand beside me in battle.

01:42.520 --> 01:43.600
And that person is not you.

01:45.880 --> 01:47.120
I'm sorry.

01:57.000 --> 01:58.160
I don't care at all.

02:23.680 --> 02:25.000
I'm sorry.

02:25.080 --> 02:27.200
I don't want to hurt you,

02:27.280 --> 02:28.880
but I don't want to keep

02:29.400 --> 02:31.400
giving you false hope either.

02:31.480 --> 02:32.560
That would be worse.

02:35.600 --> 02:38.880
BAI RESIDENCE

02:43.560 --> 02:45.000
Have Zhou Wang

02:45.080 --> 02:47.440
replicate all the patterns
he's woven before.

02:48.040 --> 02:50.400
Tell him to buy
some looms and silk thread secretly.

02:50.480 --> 02:51.960
And then, ship them in batches to Nanzhao.

02:52.040 --> 02:54.000
Remember, don't leave any traces.

02:55.280 --> 02:57.760
As for that pattern brought back
by the Yu family from Gubei Village,

02:57.840 --> 02:58.680
do you want me to steal it?

02:59.520 --> 03:01.360
Let's leave it with Ji Yingying.

03:01.440 --> 03:04.160
I believe she'll surprise me.

03:05.600 --> 03:08.160
Didn't you want to use that pattern

03:08.240 --> 03:09.480
to win over the Yu family?

03:10.560 --> 03:12.040
But now, Ji Yingying

03:12.120 --> 03:14.800
is more important to me
than the Yu family.

03:15.400 --> 03:17.080
Rather than winning over the Yu family,

03:17.160 --> 03:19.680
it's better to win over Ji Yingying.

03:44.680 --> 03:45.600
Yingying,

03:46.680 --> 03:47.680
Mr. Yang is looking for you.

03:49.360 --> 03:50.760
What does he want?

03:51.840 --> 03:53.400
Isn't there enough trouble already?

03:54.320 --> 03:56.280
Yaoting, tell him I'm busy.

03:56.360 --> 03:57.400
Looks like…

03:59.000 --> 03:59.840
you are really busy.

04:02.800 --> 04:03.680
I'll let you guys talk.

04:09.160 --> 04:10.600
Shu Red Silk is being dyed.

04:10.680 --> 04:13.360
You're supervising a bit too frequently.

04:14.480 --> 04:16.560
After all, it's tribute brocade silk.

04:16.640 --> 04:18.399
We can never be too careful.

04:19.200 --> 04:20.279
Then, have a look.

04:20.360 --> 04:22.840
Is this Shu Red the same
as the one you had in mind?

05:12.320 --> 05:13.640
I visited Mr. Yu.

05:14.440 --> 05:16.080
I know what happened in the village.

05:19.840 --> 05:20.840
I've also looked into Bai Sheng.

05:25.560 --> 05:26.960
He's a smart merchant

05:27.040 --> 05:28.400
with an unclear background

05:28.480 --> 05:29.440
and unclear intentions.

05:29.960 --> 05:31.200
I know this.

05:34.680 --> 05:37.640
But in Yizhou, most merchants

05:37.720 --> 05:40.320
have some hidden depths
and aren't really harmless.

05:40.400 --> 05:43.000
At least he's not afraid of the Niu family
or the Zhao family.

05:44.240 --> 05:47.320
If necessary, rather than choosing someone
tangled up in problems,

05:47.400 --> 05:49.120
why not pull this newcomer

05:49.200 --> 05:50.720
to our side?

05:50.800 --> 05:52.280
- When there's…
- When there's no way left,

05:52.360 --> 05:53.480
why not give it a try?

05:55.480 --> 05:56.320
It makes sense.

05:57.520 --> 05:58.480
Ji Yingying,

05:59.000 --> 06:00.560
I'm not trying to stop you.

06:00.640 --> 06:02.000
I just want to tell you,

06:02.080 --> 06:03.400
in such an unknown place,

06:03.480 --> 06:05.320
with such a mysterious person,

06:05.400 --> 06:08.000
why don't you call your ally to join you?

06:08.080 --> 06:09.160
Is it that difficult?

06:09.880 --> 06:11.760
Who asked me

06:11.840 --> 06:13.160
to give you support before?

06:16.640 --> 06:18.400
- Why are you so angry?
- I…

06:21.080 --> 06:24.640
Zhao Xiuyuan also said before
that he would always stand by me,

06:24.720 --> 06:25.960
but what happened?

06:27.480 --> 06:30.280
I've known him since childhood,
and I got this.

06:35.080 --> 06:36.320
I'm not doubting you.

06:36.840 --> 06:38.880
I just have gotten used

06:39.840 --> 06:42.280
to not relying on things I can't control.

06:43.160 --> 06:44.920
I only trust my own hands

06:45.000 --> 06:46.360
to make myself stronger,

06:47.600 --> 06:48.560
doing things faster and faster.

07:35.240 --> 07:36.320
I'm not him.

07:38.160 --> 07:39.200
I am Yang Jinglan.

07:41.440 --> 07:43.360
I will keep my promise

07:44.560 --> 07:46.040
for the rest of my life.

07:47.440 --> 07:48.520
Sharing glory and shame together,

07:49.640 --> 07:50.800
I'll never leave you.

08:12.200 --> 08:13.520
I… I know.

08:15.160 --> 08:17.640
Having an ally like you

08:17.720 --> 08:19.040
is my good fortune.

08:50.800 --> 08:51.920
What's wrong?

08:56.080 --> 08:58.440
I… I still have to continue dyeing silk.

08:58.520 --> 08:59.840
You'd better go back now.

09:01.040 --> 09:03.520
- Yaoting!
- I'm coming!

09:07.040 --> 09:08.560
Yaoting, see Mr. Yang out.

09:10.000 --> 09:12.040
Mr. Yang, this way, please.

09:13.320 --> 09:14.760
Are you really fine?

09:34.560 --> 09:36.480
I will keep my promise

09:37.280 --> 09:39.120
for the rest of my life.

09:39.800 --> 09:40.880
Sharing glory and shame together,

09:41.960 --> 09:43.160
I'll never leave you.

10:31.080 --> 10:31.920
Yaoting!

10:32.440 --> 10:34.880
I've thought of a great idea
to add the finishing touch.

10:35.480 --> 10:36.640
What's the idea?

10:52.680 --> 10:53.920
Dear.

10:56.200 --> 10:57.240
Get out.

10:59.560 --> 11:00.400
Dear,

11:00.920 --> 11:03.040
I've personally made
this ginseng soup for you.

11:04.680 --> 11:06.400
You've worked hard recently.

11:08.360 --> 11:11.520
Drink the soup
and come back to rest with me.

11:18.720 --> 11:19.760
Dear,

11:20.520 --> 11:22.640
we've been married for a while now,

11:22.720 --> 11:24.520
yet you sleep in the study every night,

11:26.120 --> 11:28.000
not even touching me once.

11:29.200 --> 11:31.880
All of the Zhao family's members
see this clearly.

11:40.760 --> 11:43.200
Do you care what others think of you?

11:43.280 --> 11:45.240
Why did we get married?

11:45.760 --> 11:48.120
The whole Zhao family knows why.

11:49.800 --> 11:53.000
Don't think I don't know
what you are planning to do.

11:57.320 --> 11:58.840
I just want a peaceful marriage,

12:00.640 --> 12:02.600
but now it seems like a plot?

12:06.800 --> 12:08.320
What kind of person are you,

12:09.320 --> 12:11.040
thinking of a peaceful marriage?

12:12.920 --> 12:15.000
You only want to get pregnant
with my child,

12:15.600 --> 12:16.760
and then I'll be useless.

12:16.840 --> 12:18.680
Then you can legitimately control

12:18.760 --> 12:20.120
the entire Zhao family.

12:27.560 --> 12:29.760
Dear, are you designing
new tribute brocade patterns?

12:31.280 --> 12:33.760
Isn't the Zhao family's old ones
good enough?

12:35.280 --> 12:37.160
Or do you want to learn from Ji Yingying

12:37.240 --> 12:39.040
to amaze everyone,

12:39.600 --> 12:41.240
to be valued by Chang'an,

12:41.320 --> 12:43.120
to be valued by the Military Commissioner?

12:43.760 --> 12:44.800
After that,

12:44.880 --> 12:47.400
you won't need to rely
on my Niu family's power anymore, right?

12:53.560 --> 12:55.680
I heard that the other day,

12:56.200 --> 12:58.320
you sent a message to Ji Yingying.

12:59.000 --> 13:00.200
As for the Yu family,

13:00.280 --> 13:03.000
you purposely excluded them

13:03.080 --> 13:05.400
and sent them to Ji Yingying, right?

13:06.720 --> 13:08.960
If my father knew

13:09.480 --> 13:12.280
that you are such a double-dealing person,

13:13.360 --> 13:14.840
I don't know what he would think.

13:15.440 --> 13:16.960
He probably hasn't had the mood lately

13:17.040 --> 13:19.400
to listen to his daughter
who's been repeatedly defeated

13:19.480 --> 13:20.520
talking nonsense.

13:22.080 --> 13:23.080
Zhao Ping!

13:25.760 --> 13:28.200
- Sir.
- From now on, no one is allowed

13:28.280 --> 13:30.200
into my room without my permission.

13:31.080 --> 13:32.200
Otherwise,

13:35.200 --> 13:36.120
beat them to death.

13:37.480 --> 13:38.320
Yes, sir.

13:42.880 --> 13:44.600
What great courage you have.

13:48.160 --> 13:49.720
Without you,

13:50.400 --> 13:52.720
my Zhao family would still weave brocade
for General Niu.

13:52.800 --> 13:54.600
But without me,

13:55.400 --> 13:57.840
you would be worthless.

13:58.840 --> 13:59.880
As for what's of greater importance,

14:01.360 --> 14:02.280
you know it better than me.

14:10.720 --> 14:12.680
YUEBUHUAN INN

14:12.760 --> 14:13.680
Sir, please come in.

14:16.320 --> 14:18.720
Mr. Yu, the brocade is about to be made.

14:18.800 --> 14:21.400
Our Bloom Society
also has skilled weavers.

14:21.480 --> 14:23.840
Today, I'd like
to recommend someone to you.

14:27.160 --> 14:29.680
I'm Ji Yaoting from the Ji family.
Greetings.

14:30.600 --> 14:31.880
I'm not good at pattern design

14:31.960 --> 14:34.520
but excel in the weaving process.

14:34.600 --> 14:36.360
I'm willing to lend a hand to you.

14:37.200 --> 14:38.280
Mr. Ji, please sit.

14:38.360 --> 14:39.840
Thank you, Mr. Yu.

14:42.760 --> 14:44.560
For nine years,

14:45.120 --> 14:46.280
my hands

14:46.840 --> 14:48.440
have never rested.

14:56.280 --> 14:58.720
Your skill is no less than before.

14:59.560 --> 15:03.000
Our workshop welcomes you to join us.

15:04.440 --> 15:05.280
Thank you, Mr. Yu.

15:07.480 --> 15:10.520
Mr. Yu,
I have another matter to discuss today.

15:11.800 --> 15:14.000
The Grain Brocade is ancient,

15:14.080 --> 15:16.000
simple, and rich in tradition,

15:16.080 --> 15:17.960
but people nowadays
are seeking something new.

15:18.040 --> 15:21.400
Just relying on the existing patterns
might not attract enough attention.

15:21.480 --> 15:24.000
I want to increase
its liveliness and shine

15:24.080 --> 15:26.160
without changing the original patterns.

15:26.760 --> 15:28.960
Perhaps by adjusting
the silk thread colors

15:29.040 --> 15:30.600
or reworking the patterns

15:30.680 --> 15:32.680
to make it gleam and shine,

15:32.760 --> 15:34.920
then, we'll get a Rippling Grain Brocade.

15:35.600 --> 15:37.560
Rippling Grain Brocade?

15:40.280 --> 15:42.320
Golden grain ears

15:43.720 --> 15:46.240
sway in the wind,

15:46.320 --> 15:50.000
stirring up waves of rice.

15:54.400 --> 15:55.320
Miss Ji,

15:56.440 --> 15:58.360
the light and dark gloss of brocade

15:58.440 --> 16:00.040
generally depends

16:00.120 --> 16:05.040
on the gloss of the silk thread
and color ratio,

16:05.120 --> 16:08.200
as well as the weaving method.

16:08.280 --> 16:13.040
To emphasize the sense of flowing waves,

16:13.120 --> 16:15.840
the technique and color ratio

16:15.920 --> 16:17.520
must be innovative.

16:18.360 --> 16:20.840
Of course, the difficulty

16:20.920 --> 16:23.960
is no less than developing
a new type of brocade.

16:26.160 --> 16:29.560
I haven't even restored

16:30.400 --> 16:32.520
the Grain Brocade pattern yet,

16:32.600 --> 16:36.360
and you want me to weave it
with a rippling effect?

16:38.920 --> 16:40.880
That truly is a hard task.

16:42.280 --> 16:44.040
My elder brother also said this yesterday.

16:45.240 --> 16:46.280
But I believe

16:46.360 --> 16:47.800
since we're going to weave it,

16:47.880 --> 16:49.600
why not make it the best we can?

16:50.600 --> 16:52.240
I can help with the coloring.

16:52.760 --> 16:55.400
We can borrow the technique
from Shu embroidery for the patterns.

16:55.480 --> 16:56.680
But for the weaving method,

16:56.760 --> 16:58.360
we still need you and the masters

16:58.440 --> 16:59.880
to study it further.

17:02.680 --> 17:06.760
Ji Yingying,
this research into Rippling Grain Brocade

17:07.319 --> 17:10.520
is not just a technical issue.

17:10.599 --> 17:13.040
So, are there any other problems?

17:13.119 --> 17:15.240
Without money, we can't weave brocade.

17:16.720 --> 17:17.800
Miss Ji,

17:18.599 --> 17:20.920
developing a technique

17:21.000 --> 17:24.319
requires a large investment at the start.

17:25.319 --> 17:27.720
But the Yu family and Bloom Society…

17:30.000 --> 17:32.000
Wasn't the money I invested before enough?

17:34.960 --> 17:37.560
Thanks to your support,

17:37.640 --> 17:40.720
we were able to provide
for the workers and looms.

17:41.880 --> 17:45.280
But to research a new brocade…

17:45.360 --> 17:46.360
How much is needed?

17:46.440 --> 17:48.160
At least 90 guan.

17:52.280 --> 17:56.080
Mr. Yu, you and Yaoting
just focus on studying how to weave it.

17:56.160 --> 17:58.320
- As for the money…
- Money?

17:59.080 --> 18:01.360
I have enough money,

18:01.440 --> 18:03.200
and I look handsome.

18:03.280 --> 18:05.320
So, why doesn't she like me?

18:08.720 --> 18:10.040
It's Mr. Sang.

18:13.360 --> 18:15.760
Miss Ji, please continue.

18:17.320 --> 18:20.240
- As for the money, I'll figure out.
- Figure it out?

18:20.840 --> 18:25.080
She doesn't like me,
but what can I figure it out?

18:26.000 --> 18:28.400
I'm not attached to her!

18:30.240 --> 18:32.600
Mr. Yu, looks like
I need to go and comfort

18:32.680 --> 18:33.600
our honorary president properly.

18:34.400 --> 18:35.440
Apologies.

18:36.040 --> 18:37.400
I've thought it over.

18:37.480 --> 18:39.040
Even if my father kills me,

18:39.640 --> 18:41.800
I'll still marry into her family!

18:41.880 --> 18:43.480
Shut up!

18:45.320 --> 18:46.600
What does it have to do with you?

18:46.680 --> 18:48.680
I can say that if I like.

18:49.400 --> 18:50.600
I still…

18:56.400 --> 18:57.600
You dare to pour on me?

18:58.120 --> 19:01.960
Don't think you can bully me
just because I don't hit women.

19:02.480 --> 19:03.320
I'm pouring it on you!

19:03.920 --> 19:05.680
Look at you, howling here.

19:05.760 --> 19:06.960
If this rumor spreads,

19:07.040 --> 19:08.520
how will Pin ever face anyone again?

19:10.120 --> 19:12.080
I didn't think that far.

19:12.160 --> 19:13.200
Then, what did you think?

19:15.080 --> 19:18.280
I just want to be
the kind of man Pin likes,

19:19.040 --> 19:21.880
who can share with her
the trials and triumphs of life,

19:21.960 --> 19:23.840
and will stand beside her in battle.

19:25.360 --> 19:29.360
But I'm not that kind of man.
What should I do, Yingying?

19:29.440 --> 19:31.840
Don't worry
about what kind of man Pin likes.

19:31.920 --> 19:35.160
Think about what kind of man
you want to be first.

19:35.760 --> 19:36.800
Me?

19:46.360 --> 19:47.320
To be a man,

19:48.560 --> 19:50.120
a man of integrity,

19:50.200 --> 19:52.400
a man with a purpose, with money to earn,

19:52.480 --> 19:54.680
and a proper man who is respected.

19:57.400 --> 19:58.960
What does that mean?

19:59.040 --> 20:01.480
You want me to join you in dyeing silk?

20:01.560 --> 20:02.920
I wouldn't know how.

20:03.000 --> 20:05.320
Everyone has their own strengths.

20:05.400 --> 20:07.560
I happen to have something that suits you.

20:08.480 --> 20:09.520
What is it?

20:10.920 --> 20:12.000
Making money.

20:19.760 --> 20:22.080
RONGJIN SILK

20:22.160 --> 20:23.400
Mr. Wang!

20:23.480 --> 20:24.560
Here!

20:25.520 --> 20:26.560
Hello, Mr. Wang.

20:28.040 --> 20:29.880
Our Bloom Society has partnered
with the Yu family

20:29.960 --> 20:31.040
to create the Rippling Grain Brocade.

20:31.120 --> 20:34.120
We warmly invite you to invest.
We hope for your support.

20:34.200 --> 20:35.400
In three days,

20:35.480 --> 20:37.160
we will have an auction
at the Yuebuhuan Inn.

20:37.240 --> 20:39.240
We would be honored if you could attend!

20:39.320 --> 20:42.160
Okay, I will definitely go
to the Bloom Society's event.

20:42.240 --> 20:43.120
I will surely attend.

20:43.200 --> 20:44.400
I will definitely support you!

20:46.520 --> 20:48.400
Rippling Grain Brocade.

20:48.480 --> 20:51.160
We warmly invite you to invest in it.
Profits will be shared.

20:52.360 --> 20:54.840
She wants us to invest
before the brocade is completed?

20:54.920 --> 20:56.360
I told you

20:56.440 --> 20:58.240
that she would surely surprise me.

20:58.760 --> 21:01.400
As long as we start from scratch
and begin again with her,

21:01.480 --> 21:03.440
we'll learn how to weave it.

21:05.280 --> 21:08.600
She and Mr. Yang are quite close,
getting along well.

21:08.680 --> 21:10.600
Mr. Yang is also investigating…

21:12.080 --> 21:14.920
Sheng, you should stay away
from Ji Yingying

21:15.000 --> 21:16.600
and avoid getting into trouble.

21:16.680 --> 21:18.840
They're in love, but I'm not interested.

21:18.920 --> 21:21.200
The one who loses won't be me.

21:22.120 --> 21:23.480
But these women,

21:23.560 --> 21:25.160
once they fall in love,

21:25.240 --> 21:27.800
it often clouds their judgment
and choices.

21:29.040 --> 21:31.280
If Ji Yingying
wants to develop her career,

21:31.360 --> 21:32.720
that's not good for her.

21:32.800 --> 21:34.680
I need to come up with a plan

21:34.760 --> 21:37.000
to keep her away from Yang Jinglan.

21:40.000 --> 21:42.680
Miss Ji really came up with a good idea.

21:42.760 --> 21:44.440
But these people
are afraid of offending Niu Jin

21:44.520 --> 21:46.120
and don't dare
to buy silk from Bloom Society, right?

21:46.200 --> 21:47.680
Do they dare to buy this brocade?

21:48.360 --> 21:51.000
Behind every wealthy brocade merchant,
no one is without support.

21:51.080 --> 21:52.560
Offending Niu Jin
because of a few baskets of silk?

21:52.640 --> 21:53.680
That's definitely not worth it.

21:53.760 --> 21:55.240
But this brocade is different.

21:55.320 --> 21:57.400
With great profits comes great risk.

21:57.480 --> 21:59.880
Even if they don't buy it,
they must still take a look.

22:02.520 --> 22:04.040
I know I'm quite carefree,

22:04.120 --> 22:06.320
but you don't have to look at me
like that.

22:08.160 --> 22:09.200
Well,

22:09.280 --> 22:10.760
you appear reckless and carefree,

22:10.840 --> 22:14.080
but actually,
you're quite practical and shrewd.

22:16.160 --> 22:17.280
You ungrateful child!

22:17.360 --> 22:19.400
Let's go! Just watch the fun.

22:20.080 --> 22:20.920
You brute!

22:29.920 --> 22:30.760
Here… Let's hide!

22:30.840 --> 22:32.640
What's going on? What's happening?

22:36.080 --> 22:39.480
Isn't that the famous Mr. Yang?

22:39.560 --> 22:41.640
Welcome!

22:43.320 --> 22:45.080
Please, come inside.

22:51.800 --> 22:53.040
Shisi,

22:53.120 --> 22:54.520
others would entertain you before,

22:54.600 --> 22:56.720
but now you're the one hosting others.

22:57.240 --> 22:58.280
Oh my!

22:58.800 --> 23:00.120
Your father's been dismissed?

23:00.680 --> 23:02.440
Can you stop bringing up my father?

23:02.520 --> 23:04.280
He gets a headache just hearing about you.

23:04.840 --> 23:06.840
I'm the honorary president
of the Bloom Society now.

23:06.920 --> 23:08.840
If anything happens, I'll definitely help.

23:08.920 --> 23:10.680
Besides, with my abilities,

23:10.760 --> 23:13.200
I can easily host guests.

23:17.680 --> 23:18.920
I just remembered.

23:19.000 --> 23:21.480
Yingying said you're the Brocade Officer.

23:22.040 --> 23:24.680
You can't place a bid,
so she didn't leave you a private room.

23:26.560 --> 23:28.920
So, you mean we should leave?

23:30.280 --> 23:31.840
Mr. Bai, this way, please.

23:35.920 --> 23:36.800
Does he have a private room?

23:37.880 --> 23:39.200
He…

23:39.760 --> 23:40.840
He does.

23:47.360 --> 23:49.000
It seems Miss Ji doesn't welcome me.

23:49.760 --> 23:53.240
Miss Ji, you're welcoming me personally.
I'm truly flattered.

23:54.520 --> 23:55.440
You're wealthy. It suits you.

23:58.320 --> 23:59.360
Mr. Yang.

24:00.480 --> 24:01.520
This way, please.

24:04.120 --> 24:05.240
I'll need a private room.

24:09.480 --> 24:11.800
Mr. Yang, Mr. Zhuge, please have a seat.

24:11.880 --> 24:13.000
This is the spot reserved for our people.

24:14.640 --> 24:15.720
Say it again.

24:15.800 --> 24:17.720
Are you going to sit or not?

24:18.920 --> 24:20.000
I'll sit.

24:20.720 --> 24:21.760
I'm one of your people.

24:23.320 --> 24:24.440
- Mr. Bai, this way.
- Let's sit.

24:24.520 --> 24:25.440
- Sit.
- After you.

24:26.520 --> 24:27.440
I'm one of her people.

24:46.000 --> 24:47.040
Feel yourself at home.

24:53.960 --> 24:55.000
Mr. Yu.

24:56.160 --> 24:58.240
You… Mrs. Yang…

24:58.320 --> 24:59.600
What's the matter?

25:00.520 --> 25:02.280
I run this inn. She's here for the feast.

25:02.360 --> 25:04.520
Everyone's here to make money.
Is there something wrong with that?

25:04.600 --> 25:05.760
I…

25:11.880 --> 25:13.200
Have a seat.

25:16.320 --> 25:17.520
Did you learn something new?

25:17.600 --> 25:20.040
Women in Shu have different temperaments.

25:20.120 --> 25:22.200
If you upset them,

25:22.280 --> 25:23.920
it's hard to calm them down.

25:28.360 --> 25:30.800
Miss Ji, may your business thrive.

25:41.880 --> 25:44.320
All colleagues from Yizhou,
greetings to all.

25:46.680 --> 25:48.040
As you all know,

25:48.120 --> 25:50.400
Our Bloom Society and the Yu family

25:50.480 --> 25:52.520
will jointly research
and weave a new brocade.

25:53.120 --> 25:57.040
As we all know,
the new brocade will certainly sell well.

25:59.160 --> 26:01.600
Today, I invite all shopkeepers here.

26:01.680 --> 26:03.520
What we are bidding on
is not the new brocade itself

26:04.280 --> 26:08.400
but the high profits it represents.

26:09.280 --> 26:12.880
The winning bidder will get a 20% share
of the profits from this new brocade.

26:12.960 --> 26:14.080
In other words,

26:14.160 --> 26:17.360
if every roll of brocade sells
for ten guan,

26:17.440 --> 26:20.200
the winning bidder will receive two guan
as their share.

26:24.440 --> 26:25.560
The new brocade is still not finished,

26:25.640 --> 26:29.120
so, today, I will show you
the design of this brocade.

26:29.880 --> 26:31.080
Please take a look.

26:39.320 --> 26:42.760
Outside Yizhou City,
there is a place called Gubei Village.

26:42.840 --> 26:44.720
It has worshiped the God of Grain
for generations.

26:44.800 --> 26:48.080
The wheat pattern brocade
is the village's belief.

26:49.320 --> 26:52.040
The wheat is a gift from the God of Grain,

26:52.880 --> 26:55.400
giving people food to fill their stomachs.

26:55.920 --> 26:58.320
The silk is a blessing from Leizu,

26:58.400 --> 27:00.960
giving people clothes to keep warm.

27:01.600 --> 27:03.440
The flowing waves on this brocade

27:03.520 --> 27:05.960
are light, water,

27:06.040 --> 27:07.280
and wind.

27:07.360 --> 27:10.160
The gifts bestowed upon us by Heaven.

27:18.960 --> 27:20.080
The starting bid is 20 guan.

27:20.160 --> 27:22.200
The auction begins.

27:47.080 --> 27:48.240
Why isn't anyone bidding?

27:49.600 --> 27:51.760
They're probably worried it can't be made.

27:52.360 --> 27:53.680
Mr. Zhuge,

27:53.760 --> 27:55.880
our Bloom Society
will never deceive others.

27:56.480 --> 27:57.400
I…

27:58.280 --> 27:59.120
I didn't mean it that way.

27:59.200 --> 28:02.600
To these people, the money
is just a drop in the bucket.

28:02.680 --> 28:04.000
They don't doubt us,

28:04.800 --> 28:06.840
but no one wants
to be the first to speak up.

28:09.080 --> 28:10.520
You won't want to bid, will you?

28:11.320 --> 28:14.080
If the Brocade Officer places a bid,
who would dare to bid after that?

28:16.200 --> 28:18.600
I don't have money.
I'm just supporting the event.

28:27.120 --> 28:28.360
This brocade

28:28.440 --> 28:29.960
has both ancient heritage

28:30.040 --> 28:31.200
and fresh innovation.

28:31.280 --> 28:32.400
I really like it.

28:34.240 --> 28:36.600
How about I take care of it

28:36.680 --> 28:38.200
and help you invite

28:38.280 --> 28:41.320
the Military Commissioner
to generously open his purse?

28:42.720 --> 28:44.000
Mr. Yang,

28:44.080 --> 28:46.800
why bother the Military Commissioner
with such a small matter?

28:47.480 --> 28:48.840
Once the brocade is made,

28:48.920 --> 28:51.280
it won't be too late to present it to him.

28:53.800 --> 28:54.840
If none of you

28:56.720 --> 28:57.840
place a bid,

28:58.640 --> 29:01.360
when will this brocade be completed?

29:03.440 --> 29:04.960
How about this, Miss Ji?

29:06.320 --> 29:08.040
If the first person to bid

29:08.120 --> 29:09.960
wins the auction for this brocade,

29:10.640 --> 29:11.600
what benefit will they get?

29:13.880 --> 29:15.000
They'll get one guan off the price.

29:15.920 --> 29:17.120
If it doesn't sell,

29:17.200 --> 29:19.200
the first bidder will get

29:19.280 --> 29:21.840
a 10% discount on their first silk order

29:21.920 --> 29:24.720
from Bloom Society in the future.

29:25.440 --> 29:27.560
Even if it doesn't sell,
there's still a benefit?

29:27.640 --> 29:29.680
- Then I bid…
- Twenty-one guan!

29:49.000 --> 29:50.600
I bid 21 guan.

29:50.680 --> 29:52.760
Is anyone going to raise the price?

30:03.880 --> 30:04.800
Sir,

30:05.720 --> 30:08.200
if the Zhao family wins the bid,

30:09.080 --> 30:10.560
this brocade may never be seen again.

30:12.320 --> 30:13.680
Let's wait a little longer.

30:15.160 --> 30:16.080
Miss Ji,

30:16.680 --> 30:18.280
the highest bidder wins.

30:18.360 --> 30:19.800
The hammer is about to fall.

30:22.720 --> 30:23.880
I bid 60 guan!

30:31.840 --> 30:32.680
Miss Ji,

30:33.600 --> 30:34.880
my wife doesn't understand brocade

30:34.960 --> 30:36.240
and doesn't know the value
of this new brocade.

30:36.840 --> 30:38.320
I'm willing to bid 60 guan.

30:45.680 --> 30:47.280
You're discrediting your own wife

30:47.360 --> 30:49.320
and raising the price for another woman.

30:49.400 --> 30:51.840
My Dear really does things
in such a unique way.

30:53.080 --> 30:54.240
I can't compare to you.

30:56.160 --> 30:58.600
Mr. Zhao, Mrs. Zhao,

30:59.280 --> 31:02.000
I remember I didn't invite you two.

31:02.080 --> 31:03.400
Why are you here?

31:05.440 --> 31:07.040
Because we've heard a lot about it.

31:07.560 --> 31:08.640
What?

31:08.720 --> 31:10.640
My husband bid on this brocade.

31:10.720 --> 31:13.000
Do you intend to deny it?

31:14.960 --> 31:16.240
You weren't here earlier,

31:16.320 --> 31:17.720
so you didn't hear my introduction.

31:18.480 --> 31:21.440
This brocade carries the belief
of an ancient village.

31:21.960 --> 31:24.240
The village has worshipped
the God of Grain for generations.

31:24.960 --> 31:26.240
Before the auction,

31:26.320 --> 31:28.480
the village chief
even had a divination done.

31:29.080 --> 31:30.960
It's forbidden for anyone
who has dealt with military affairs.

31:32.080 --> 31:33.640
That's why I didn't invite you two.

31:33.720 --> 31:36.320
You can't bid, I'm afraid.

31:38.280 --> 31:40.440
Since when do the customs
of a wild village

31:40.520 --> 31:42.680
require the Brocade Master to follow?

31:44.320 --> 31:45.880
Do you all still remember

31:45.960 --> 31:47.560
who is the leader

31:47.640 --> 31:49.160
of the Yizhou brocade industry?

31:57.640 --> 32:00.560
I've already reported this matter
to the Brocade Bureau.

32:02.440 --> 32:07.160
I think I'm worth the Brocade Master
and his wife

32:07.240 --> 32:08.640
to observe this rule.

32:10.960 --> 32:12.360
It's really hard
to go against Heaven's will

32:12.440 --> 32:13.720
and the law of the land.

32:13.800 --> 32:16.320
I cannot give this brocade to you two.

32:19.120 --> 32:20.360
Fine,

32:20.440 --> 32:21.880
then I will see for myself

32:21.960 --> 32:23.240
who heaven and the law will favor

32:23.320 --> 32:25.920
and whose hands this brocade
will fall into.

32:33.400 --> 32:37.600
Fine, then I'll let you have a good look.

32:38.840 --> 32:40.080
Please, lift the curtain.

32:43.680 --> 32:46.160
"A common man is innocent,
but holding jade is a crime."

32:46.240 --> 32:47.680
I had also anticipated

32:47.760 --> 32:49.640
that you might not want
to make a big scene,

32:49.720 --> 32:51.400
so I made early preparations.

32:52.040 --> 32:55.320
Each room has its own number,
a silk thread,

32:55.840 --> 32:57.440
corresponding to a bell on stage.

32:57.520 --> 32:58.360
SIGN "EARTH NO. 1"

32:58.440 --> 33:02.320
Who does the bell belong to?
Only you and the Bloom Society know.

33:02.400 --> 33:03.280
It will not be leaked.

33:04.560 --> 33:05.880
If anyone wants to bid,

33:05.960 --> 33:07.760
pull the thread in your hand.

33:07.840 --> 33:08.920
When the bell rings,

33:09.000 --> 33:10.840
it means a five-guan increase.

33:16.920 --> 33:19.840
Everyone, let the auction continue!

33:42.920 --> 33:45.240
SIGN "EARTH NO. 1"

33:52.760 --> 33:54.240
SIGN "EARTH NO. 1"

33:56.400 --> 33:58.600
Earth No. 1 bids 25 guan.

34:05.160 --> 34:07.760
Yellow No. 2 bids 30 guan.

34:12.960 --> 34:15.080
Heaven No. 1 bids 35 guan.

34:18.400 --> 34:19.520
SIGN "EARTH NO. 1"

34:24.000 --> 34:26.280
Earth No. 1 bids 50 guan!

34:35.159 --> 34:37.080
Fifty guan is not a small amount.

34:37.159 --> 34:38.800
Miss Ji, are you satisfied now?

34:40.440 --> 34:42.320
My price in my mind is 90.

34:45.719 --> 34:47.800
Earth No. 1 bid 50 guan.

34:48.320 --> 34:49.760
Is anyone raising the bid?

34:56.719 --> 34:58.320
We, the Yang family,
are willing to bid 70 guan.

34:58.400 --> 34:59.840
Seventy!

35:02.040 --> 35:03.280
Seventy guan!

35:06.680 --> 35:08.520
Isn't this supposed to be blind bidding?

35:08.600 --> 35:10.040
What does the Yang family mean by this?

35:11.520 --> 35:13.160
Mrs. Yang is truly brave.

35:21.760 --> 35:22.680
Crooked merchant.

35:25.000 --> 35:26.080
It's still not reaching 90.

35:26.160 --> 35:28.640
It seems you're not worried
about me at all.

35:29.560 --> 35:32.680
When it comes to doing business,
you're more talented.

35:33.240 --> 35:35.120
I'm looking forward to your next move.

35:47.360 --> 35:48.320
SIGN "EARTH NO. 1"

35:51.240 --> 35:53.720
Earth No. 1 bids 80 guan!

35:53.800 --> 35:56.760
This Earth No. 1 seems determined to win.

36:04.160 --> 36:05.080
Go ahead.

36:10.640 --> 36:13.360
I am willing to bid 90 guan.

36:23.960 --> 36:25.800
We, the Yang family, bid 95 guan.

36:28.960 --> 36:30.760
I offer 100 guan.

36:47.400 --> 36:48.280
One hundred guan, once.

36:51.840 --> 36:53.120
SIGN "EARTH NO. 1"

36:53.200 --> 36:55.840
One hundred guan is more than enough!

36:55.920 --> 36:57.640
So, can we withdraw

36:57.720 --> 36:59.880
after completing our task?

37:08.640 --> 37:10.040
One hundred guan, once.

37:18.600 --> 37:20.520
Earth No. 1 bids

37:21.040 --> 37:22.640
105 guan.

37:33.240 --> 37:34.480
Thanks to my great idea.

37:34.560 --> 37:36.840
But you both

37:36.920 --> 37:39.000
don't understand people's hearts.

37:43.920 --> 37:46.640
Earth No. 1 bid 105 guan.

37:47.200 --> 37:48.920
Is there anyone else
willing to raise the bid?

38:02.160 --> 38:03.680
One hundred five guan, once.

38:11.720 --> 38:13.440
One hundred five guan, twice.

38:14.680 --> 38:15.520
Twice already!

38:18.760 --> 38:20.200
This should not be happening.

38:20.880 --> 38:22.600
I've dominated the gambling scene
for so many years,

38:22.680 --> 38:24.440
and I can clearly see
that Bai Sheng will win this.

38:24.520 --> 38:28.080
If this fails, Yingying will kill us…

38:28.160 --> 38:29.000
She will kill you!

38:33.520 --> 38:34.680
Mr. Bai,

38:35.920 --> 38:36.800
do you want to raise the bid?

38:44.880 --> 38:46.360
I think

38:47.520 --> 38:49.520
it's better not to steal from others.

38:56.120 --> 38:58.320
Miss Ji, please go ahead.

39:05.760 --> 39:09.640
Earth No. 1, 105 guan, three times.

39:11.720 --> 39:12.760
Sold.

39:25.760 --> 39:26.680
It's Sang Shisi, right?

39:27.800 --> 39:28.960
Unworthy guy.

40:05.200 --> 40:07.280
Miss Ji, you don't need to be so polite.

40:07.360 --> 40:10.400
I just placed two bids to support you.

40:15.040 --> 40:16.000
"Earth No. 1" is us.

40:20.240 --> 40:21.720
I really didn't expect this.

40:21.800 --> 40:24.360
Miss Ji, you're so honest.

40:31.440 --> 40:33.280
You have already seen through it.

40:33.360 --> 40:34.840
Why should I hide it?

40:36.440 --> 40:37.920
This Rippling Grain Brocade

40:38.000 --> 40:40.920
has some connection with you.

40:41.000 --> 40:42.960
Are you willing to invest?

40:44.760 --> 40:46.240
I feel that

40:46.320 --> 40:48.560
the Yang family's bid is quite generous.

40:48.640 --> 40:51.000
Why do you choose me?

40:51.880 --> 40:53.800
The Yang family has too many rules.

40:53.880 --> 40:56.880
The pattern isn't even finished yet.
The process is so difficult.

40:58.080 --> 41:00.120
If I'm not wrong,

41:00.200 --> 41:01.920
the Yang family rejected you

41:02.000 --> 41:03.200
because they thought

41:03.280 --> 41:04.800
if they didn't win the bid publicly

41:04.880 --> 41:07.120
but still got the brocade,

41:07.800 --> 41:08.840
they would carry the reputation

41:08.920 --> 41:12.480
of secretly stealing
the anonymous buyer's goods.

41:12.560 --> 41:14.760
That reputation doesn't sound good.

41:14.840 --> 41:16.040
However,

41:16.960 --> 41:19.880
my reputation in your eyes

41:19.960 --> 41:20.880
is also insignificant.

41:22.160 --> 41:23.320
Not at all, Mr. Bai.

41:25.320 --> 41:26.680
I'm just curious.

41:28.040 --> 41:30.160
Why are you so certain

41:30.240 --> 41:31.440
that I'll agree to your terms?

41:32.720 --> 41:35.920
You always know clearly what you want.

41:36.440 --> 41:38.240
Since you already anticipated
what I would say,

41:38.320 --> 41:39.560
why bother coming here

41:40.080 --> 41:40.920
if you're not interested?

41:43.480 --> 41:44.320
Fine.

41:44.880 --> 41:47.600
I can give the money,
but I have my own rules.

41:48.200 --> 41:49.160
Please, Mr. Bai.

41:49.240 --> 41:51.800
First, within three months,
the new brocade must be completed.

41:52.680 --> 41:53.640
- Fine.
- Second,

41:53.720 --> 41:55.960
how the brocade pattern is designed
and how it is woven…

41:56.040 --> 41:56.960
I must know everything.

41:57.040 --> 42:00.680
Third, I need to oversee the work
at the Yu family brocade workshop.

42:03.320 --> 42:05.080
The Yu family brocade workshop
is not like the Ji family

42:05.160 --> 42:06.400
or the Bloom Society.

42:06.480 --> 42:07.800
I can't make decisions alone.

42:07.880 --> 42:09.600
This must be decided with Mr. Yu.

42:09.680 --> 42:11.280
I agree.

42:15.600 --> 42:17.720
- Greetings, Mr. Yu.
- Greetings, Mr. Yu.

42:22.960 --> 42:24.120
I need you to invest 100 guan.

42:26.760 --> 42:28.280
Not less than that.

42:29.160 --> 42:31.360
As for the weaving, you can only watch.

42:31.880 --> 42:33.040
No interference is allowed.

42:33.680 --> 42:35.360
I'll follow your arrangements.

42:35.440 --> 42:37.120
Then, I wish you two

42:38.000 --> 42:39.320
smooth progress in your work.
